# News Assets Directory

Place news article images here with the following naming convention:
- news1-placeholder.jpg
- news2-placeholder.jpg
- news3-placeholder.jpg
- etc.

Recommended specifications:
- Format: JPG or PNG
- Size: At least 1920x1080px
- Aspect ratio: 16:9 (landscape)
- File size: Under 500KB for optimal performance

These images will be displayed in:
- News cards on the main news section
- Featured image in news detail modal
